    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate or Perish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoLight is a fast-paced arena roguelite where you wield light to fend off waves of geometric foes and grow stronger with every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Core Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-Based Combat \u2013 Fire beams, bursts, and area pulses. Dodge through shifting patterns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable Runs \u2013 Choose your build: elemental lights, passive boosts, overdrives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Waves \u2013 Unpredictable enemy formations and boss battles keep each run fresh.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaprogress + Permadeath \u2013 Unlock new abilities and permanent upgrades across runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Sessions, Deep Replay \u2013 Jump in for a few minutes or grind through intense wave sequences.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate or Perish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoLight is a fast-paced arena roguelite where you wield light to fend off waves of geometric foes and grow stronger with every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Core Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-Based Combat \u2013 Fire beams, bursts, and area pulses. Dodge through shifting patterns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable Runs \u2013 Choose your build: elemental lights, passive boosts, overdrives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Waves \u2013 Unpredictable enemy formations and boss battles keep each run fresh.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaprogress + Permadeath \u2013 Unlock new abilities and permanent upgrades across runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Sessions, Deep Replay \u2013 Jump in for a few minutes or grind through intense wave sequences.</p></li></ul>",
